<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="LAM" style="id">Lamentations</book>
  <para style="h">Lamentations</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lamentations</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lamentations</para>
  <para style="mt">Lamentations</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mipuia khat ṭhîn khawpui kha khawhara a ṭhut tâk chu! Hnamte zînga ropui ṭhîn kha, hmeithai ang a lo ni ta a! Ram bialte zînga lian ber ṭhîn kha, chhiah khua a lo chang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zânah lungchhe vânkaiin ṭap a, a biangah mittui a luang e; A nei nêm maw, thlamuantu tûr, a ngainatu zawng zîngah; A ṭhiante zawng zawngin an bum a, a hmêlma an chang zo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Juda chu sal tân khur a lût ta a, hrehawm leh sala chhawr tuarin; A chêng ta e ânpai zîngah, chawlhna rêng a tawng lo ve; A ûmtu zawngten an nangchîng, a chêp lai takin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zion khawpui kawngte chu a ngui ruai, Kûtpui urhsûn kal awm loh vângin; A kulh kawngka zawng zawng a ram zo, a puithiamte an rûm a. A nulaten an tuar a, ani lahin na a ti êm êm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A hnehchhiahtute chu hotuah an chang zo ve, A hmêlmate an hlawhtling, Lalpan a tuartîr tâk hi, a bawhchhiat tam avângin; Hnehchhiahtu hmaah a hraichawite sal tân khur an lût ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Zion fanu chu a mawina zawngin a bosan ta e, A hotute zukchal tlat hmun nei lo ang an chang zo ta; Ûmtu maan an tlân e, tha leh zungzâm rêng nei lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hrehawm mangan nîah Jerusalem chuan a hre reng a, A hmasang thil hlu zawng zawngte; Hnehchhiahtu kuta a mite an tlûk laiin, ani chu tu mah rêngin an pui lo, Hnehchhiahtuten an en a, a chim chu an diriam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem a sual ta êm, chuvâng chuan thil thianghlim lo a lo chang ta; A zahtu zawngten an hmusit, a saruak an hmuh vângin; A ni, lungngaiin a ni a rûm a, lehlam a hawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A puan hmâwrah bawlhhlawh a kai; a hun tâwp tûr a ngaihtuah lo; Chuvâng chuan mak takin a tlâwm, Thlamuantu rêng a nei lo ve. “En teh, aw Lalpa , ka hrehawmna hi, hmêlma a intiropui si!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hnehchhiahtu chuan a kut a lek a, a thil hlû zawng zawng chungah chuan; A hmun thianghlimah chuan ânpaiho an lût a hmu e, Inkhâwmna hmuna luh i khapteho kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A mite zawng zawng an rûm e, ei tûr zawngin; An thil hlû zawng zawng an pe zo, nun tihharhna chaw atân. “Aw Lalpa , ngai la, en teh, hmuhsitawm ka nih tâk hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“In tân eng mah lo mai em ni, kawnga veivâk zawng zawngte u? Ngai ula, en teh mah u, ka chunga thleng ka lungngaihna ang lungngaihna a awm em ni? A thinrim nasat nia Lalpan min tihhrehawmna hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chung lam ata mei a tîr a, ka ruh chhûngah a luhtîr a; Ka ke tân lên a zâr a, mi tikîr a; Rilru bo rum rumin chau takin mi siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka bawhchhiatna hi phurrit atân têl khâwm a ni a, Ama kut ngeia têl khâwm a ni; Mi phurhtîr ta a, ka tha a tichau zo ta; Ka do zawh lohte kutah min pe a, Lalpa ngei chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpan ka mi chakte chu eng mah lovan a siam, kan zîngah; Keima chungah pung khâwm a ko ve, Ka vâl rual tiral tûrin; Grêp sâwrna khur iangin Lalpan a chîl, Juda fanu thianghlim chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hêng vâng hian ka ṭap a, ka chhîngmit tui ang luang e; Thlamuantu, min tiharhtu tûr awmna kâr hlat vângin; Ka hraichawite awmkhua a har ngei, Hmêlmain a hneh vângin.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zion-in a kut a phar vêl, Thlamuantu tûr awm lo ve; Lalpan Jakob-ho chungchângah a vêla awm zawng zawng hnehchhiahtu ni tûrin a rêl ta; Jerusalem chu an zîngah thil thianghlim lo a lo chang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“ Lalpa chu a fel a ni e, a thupêk chungah ka hel si; Mipui zawng zawngte u, ngaithla ula, ka lungngaihna hi en teh u; Ka nula thianghlim leh vâl rual sal tân khur an lût ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi ngainatute ka ko va, anni chuan mi bum ta zâwk a; Ka puithiam leh ka upate khawpuiah an boral ta; An nun tihharhna tûr chaw an zawn laiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ngai teh, ka hrehawmzia mai hi, ka kawchhûng a buai zo ta; Ka thinlung a vai, ka chhûngah, sual takin ka hel ta si. Kawtthlêrah khandaihin a sûntîr a, in chhûngah pawh thihna ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka rûm an hria, mi thlamuan tûr rêng an awm lo ve. Ka hmêlma zawngten ka buaina hi an hria e, I thiltih tâk hi an lâwm a ni. Ni i ruat tawh chu i thlentîr a, anni chu keimah ang ni ve rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An sualna zawng zawng i hmaah lo thleng rawh se; Ka bawhchhiatnate avânga ka chunga i tih ang hian an chungah ti ve ang che; Ka rûmna a tam ta si a, ka thinlung a chau ta.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpan a thinrimin Zion fanu chhûmin a khuh tâk chu! Vân ata leiah a paih thla e, Israel mawina chu; A ke nghahchhan a hre reng lo, a thinrim nîah chuanin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a lem zo va, Jakob-ho chênna zawng zawng a zuah lo ve; A thinurin a nam thlu a, Juda fanu kulh nghette chu; Lei thleng rawka tichimin a titlâwm e, ram leh a hotute chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel kî zawng zawng chu thinrim takin a tan chhum a; Hmêlma hmaan a kut ding lam a hnûk kîr e, Meialh a vêl kâng faitu angin Jakob-ho zîngah a alh chhuak e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hmêlma angin thal ngul a kuai, hnehchhiahtu angin a kut ding lam a dintîr a; Zion fanu puan inah mit latu ṭha zawng a that zo va; Mei angin a thinur a leih bua a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chu hmêlma ang a lo ni ta, Israel a lem zo ta; A in ropui zawng zawng a lem zo, a kulh nghette a tichhia! A tipung ta lusûn, ṭah hla, Juda fanu zîngah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A bûk chu a tichim ta, huan bûk ang maiin, A kûtpuite hmun a tichhia a; Lalpa chuan Zion-ah kûtpui leh Chawlhni a hlamchhiahtîr a, Lungawi lo takin lal leh puithiamte chu a hnâwl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpan a maichâm a paih bo va, a hmun thianghlim a lungten; Hmêlma kutah a pe ta e, a in ropuite kulh chu; Kûtpui ni ang maiin Lalpa inah an au dur dur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Zion fanu kulh chu tihchim a tum ta a, Tehnain a chhinchhiah a, tihchhiat nân a kut a sûm lo ve; Kulh hmatâwng leh kulhte chu lû a sûntîr a, an ngui dûn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kulh kawngkâte leiah an pil, a thîr tlâwn a tichhe bung rum e; A lalber leh a hotute ânpaiho zîngah an awm e, dân chu a awm ta lo; A zâwlneite lahin Lalpa ata inlârna rêng an hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zion fanu upate chu leiah an ṭhu, ngawi rengin; An luah vaivut an phul a, saiip puan an sin a; Jerusalem nula lei siin an kaikûn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka mit ka ṭah chhe zo va, ka kawchhûng a buai zo ta; Ka thinlung a inleih bua leiah, ka mipui fanu boral vângin; Nautê leh hnute hne laite chu khawpui tualah an chauh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An nute hnênah chuan, “Khawiah nge buh leh uain?” tiin, Hliam ang maiin khawpui tualah an thidang a; An nute ângchhûngah an nun a chuai ral e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Eng nge ka hriattîr ang chia, eng nge ka tehkhin ang che, aw Jerusalem fanu? Eng ang nge i ni ka tih ang, Ka han thlamuan theih nân che, aw Zion fanu thianghlim? I chhiatna hi a zau ve tuipui angin; Tu nge tidam thei ang che?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I zâwlneiten i tân inlârna lawi lo leh âtthlâk an hmu a, Din ṭha leh tûr chein i khawlohnate an tilang lo va; I tân thu lawi lo leh bumnaa khat an hmu zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kawnga veivâk zawng zawngten an kut an ben khum che a, Jerusalem fanu an sî khumin an lû an thin khum a: “He khawpui hi maw mawina famkim, lei pum pui hlimna an tih chu?” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I hmêlma zawng zawngten an ân khum che; An sî khum a, an ha ṭhialin: “Kan lem zo ta! He ni hi kan thlîr ṭhin ngei kha a ni, Kan dawng ta a, kan hmu ta e,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpan a tum chu a tizo va, Hmâna a ruat angin a thu a hlen ta; A paih thla e, lainat lovin; Hmêlma chu i chungah a lâwmtîr e, Nangmah hnehchhiahtute kî chu a chawisâng ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa hnênah an thinlung a au ta a! “Aw Zion fanu kulhpui! Mittui a chhûn a zânin luang zur zur rawh se; Nang châwl suh la, i mittui pawh hân suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tho la, zânah vên ṭan tirhan au chhuak rawh, I thinlung chu tui angin leih chhuak ang che Lalpa hmaan; Ama lamah i kut phar la, i fanau kawtthlêr tawntirh tina rilṭâma chaute nunna atân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />En la, aw Lalpa , ngai teh, hetianga i tih tâkate hi! Hmeichhiaten an rîla rah, fanau an duat laite chu an ei tûr em ni? Puithiam leh zâwlnei Lalpa hmun thianghlimah chuan thahin an awm tûr em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tleirâwl leh putar kawtthlêr laian an thal phung e, Ka nula leh vâl rual khandaih avângin an tlu; Nangin i thinrim nîah chuan i that ta, I sâm buan e lainat lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kûtpui ni angin ka râp zâwngte kil tin ata i ko va, Lalpa thinrim nîah chuan tlân chhuak leh zuah rêng an awm lo ve; Ka chawi leh ka kaih tlei tâkte chu ka hmêlmain a tiboral ta.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A thinurna talhtum hnuaia tihhrehawmna hretu ka ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thimah mi khalh lûtin mi kaltîr a, êngah ni lovin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima chungah nilêngin a kut a thlâk a thlâk ngei mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka tîsa leh vun a tisâwng a, ka ruhte a titliak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka lakah dai a theu va, khâkna leh hrehawmnain mi hung;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hmun thimah mi chêntîr a, thi daih tawhte angin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka chhuah theih loh nân mi hung vêl a; ka khaidiat a tirit a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ni, ṭanpui ka ngena ka au pawhin ka dîlna a khâr hnan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lungchherin ka kalkawngte a hnawh a, ka kawngte a tikawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka lakah savawm mî châng ang, sakeibaknei tawm ru khiau ang mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka kawngte mi hruai kawisak a, mi pawt sawm a, khawhar takin mi siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thal ngul a kuai a, a kah tumah mi dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A bâwma thalfungte chu ka kawchhûngah a kâp lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka mite zawng zawng tân nuihzatbûr ka lo ni ta, nilênga an hla nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ani chuan thil khâin mi tikhat a, saiin mi tihnê a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lung ṭhîlah ka hâte mi tauh baltîr a, vaivutah mi vahtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangin muanna ata ka nunna i sawn daih a, Thawvenna chu eng a nih pawh ka hre ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, “Ka ropuina leh Lalpa laka ka beisei chu a bo zo ta,” ka ti ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka tuarna leh ka vahvaihna, sai leh mît khâte chu hre reng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka nunna hian chûngte chu a hre reng zêl a, Ka chhûngah hian a kun reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hei hi ka han hre chhuak leh ta a, Chuvâng chuan beiseina ka nei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tihborala ka awm lo hi Lalpa zahngaihna a lo ni, A lainatnate chu a kang ngai loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A thar zêl ṭhîn tûk tinin, i rinawmna a ropui e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“ Lalpa chu ka chanpual a ni,” ka nunnain a ti a, “Chuvângin, amah chu ka beisei ang!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpa chu amah nghâktute tân a ṭha a, amah zawngtu tân chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lalpa chhandamna beiseia nghah veng veng chu a ṭha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi, a tleirâwl laia nghâwngkawl bah chu a ṭha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A bahtîr tawh avângin amahin ṭhu sela, ngawi reng rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A kâ vaivutah dah sela, beisei a la awm dah law maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A bêngtu hnênah a biang dawh sela, sawichhiatin khat rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lalpa chuan kumkhuain a paih bo dâwn si lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tilungngai mah sela, a zahngaihna nasa tak avângin a la khawngaih dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mihring fate tihhrehawm leh tihvui hi a duh zâwng a ni si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Lei sal tâng zawng zawng rah beh te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chungnungbera hmaihmaa mi dikna hnâwl te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mi thu tihkhawlohsak te hi Lalpa remtih zâwng a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lalpan thu a pêk loh chuan thusawi tithleng theitu chu tu a ni nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Thil ṭha leh ṭha lo hi Chungnungbera kâ aṭanga chhuak a ni lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A sual hremnaah engati nge mi nung a phunnawi reng?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Kan kawngte chu fiahin en ngun ila, Lalpa lam i hawi ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Kan thinlung chu kan kutte nên vâna Pathian lamah chuan i chawikâng ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Kan bawhchhia a, kan hel a, nangin min ngaidam lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Thinrimnain in inkhuh a, min ûm a, khawngaih lovin i that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Chhûmin i inkhuh a; chutichuan, ṭawngṭaina a kal tlang thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mipuite zîngah hian bawlhhlawh leh hnâwmhnawkah min siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Kan hmêlmate zawng zawng chuan kan chungah an kâ an âng zau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hlauhna leh khuarkhurumin mi nang a, chhiatna leh boralna nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ka mipui fanu boral avângin ka mit chu lui tui angin a luang ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ka mit chu chhum lo chat lovin, hân chuang lovin a luang chhuak ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Lalpan vân aṭanga mi zuk ena mi hmuh thlengin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Ka khawpui fanute zawng zawng avângin, ka mitin ka rilru a tilungngai e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Chhan awm lova mi dotute chuan sava angin mi ûm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Nung chungin khuarkhurumah mi theh thla ta a, Ka chungah lung an thlâk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tuiin mi chîm pil a, “Ka boral ta!” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Khuarkhurum hnuaihnung ber aṭang chuan, aw Lalpa , i hming ka lam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Ka aw chu nangin i hria a, ka thâwk laa ka au thâwmah i beng hup suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Nang ka auh che nîah khân i lo hnai a, “Hlau suh!” i ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Aw Lalpa, ka thiamna thu mi sawisak a, ka nunna i tlan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka chunga thil dik lote hi i hmu a, ka thu mi rêlsak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />An phuba lâkna zawng zawng leh an mi phiarna zawng zawngte chu i hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , an mi sawichhiatna leh mi phiarna zawng zawngte chu i hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Mi beitute hmui leh ngaihtuahnate chu nilêngin ka chungah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />An ṭhu leh an dingte hi en teh; an hla ka ni mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , an kut hnathawhte ang zêlin nang chuan i thungrûl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Thinlung sak i neihtîr ang a, i ânchhia an chungah a tla ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Thinrimin i ûm ang a, Lalpa vân hnuai ata chu i tiboral ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rangkachak chu a va thîm ta êm! Rangkachak thianghlim ber chu a va danglam êm! Hmun thianghlim lungte chu kawtthlêr tawntirh tinah paih darh a ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zion fapa hlu tak, rangkachak ṭha mi nêna tehkhin theihte chu Hlum bêl, bêlvawtu kutchhuak ang maia ngaih lah ni ta!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sihalte mahin an notê an hnutê an pe, an hnêktîr a; Ka mipui fanu erawh chu a nun a lo chhia, thlalêra vanghâwngsei ang maiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nau hnute hne lai lei chu tuihâl vângin a dangah a bet a; Naupangte chuan chaw an ngên a, tu mah rêngin an pe lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chaw ṭha ei ṭhînte chu kawtthlêrah an boral a; Puan sen duk sina sei liante chuan êk dûrte an kuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka mipui fanu khawlohna chu Sodom sualna aiin a nasa a, Kut rêng pawha khawih loh va mit khap kâr lova tihchhiata kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A mi liante chu vûr aia thianghlim an ni a, hnute tui aia vâr an ni; Taksaah chuan rubi aiin an sâr zâwk a, an mawizia chu sapphir ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An lan dân chu lungalhthei aiin a dum zâwk a, kawtthlêrahte chuan hriat an ni lo; An vun chu an ruhahte a bet a, hmawlh angin a ro va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An ṭha zâwk e khandaiha thi, rilṭâma thi ai zawngin, An râwp ral a, lova thlai tharte tlachhamin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lainattu hmeichhiate kut chuan mahni fate an chhûm a; Ka mipui fanu tihchhiatnaah chuan an chawah an chang ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpan a thinur a hlen ta, a thinrim hlauhawm a leih chhuak; Zion-ah mei a tialh a, lungphûmte lamin a kâng zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lei lalte chuan an ring lo va, khawvêla chêng zawng zawng pawhin; Hnehchhiahtu leh hmêlma Jerusalem kulh kawngkaa an luh theih tûr chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hei hi a zâwlneite thil tihsual leh a puithiamte khawloh vâng a ni, A chhûnga mi dik thisen chhuahtu chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mitdelin kawtthlêrahte an vâkvai a, thisenin an bawlhhlawh a; Miten an silhfênte an khawih theih loh hial khawpin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Kal bo rawh u, thianghlim lote u! Kal bo rawh u, kal bo rawh u! Dek suh u!” tiin miten an au va, Tlânchhia leh vâkvai an lo ni ta a, Miten hnamte zîngah, “Hetah an chêng tawh lo vang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa ngei chuan a theh darh a, a ngaihsak tawh lo vang; Puithiamten zah an hlawh lo va, upaten duhsak an hlawh hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ṭanpuina thlâwn thlîrin kan mit a vai zo va; Chhandam thei lo hnam chu nghah zawng kan nghâk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Miin kan hnu an chhui, khawlai kan lêng thei lo ve; Kan tâwp a hnai, kan ni a kim; kan tâwpna a thleng ta si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Min ûmtute chu vân mupuite aiin an chak zâwk; Tlângahte chuan min ûm a, thlalêrahte chuan min châng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kan hnâra thâw, Lalpa hriak thiha chu an khurah manin a awm ta; “Hnamte zîngah a zâr hnuaiah kan chêng ve ang,” kan tih ṭhina kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aw Edom fanu, Uz rama chêng chu hlimin lâwm rawh se. No chu i hnên pawh a lo thleng ang a, i rui ang a, Saruakin i insiam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aw Zion fanu, i khawlohna hremna chu a kim ta e; Salah a hrêng tawh lo vang che, Aw Edom fanu, i khawlohna chu a rawn hrem dâwn a; I sualte chu a hmu chhuak ang!
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , kan chunga lo thleng chu hre reng ang che; Ngai la, kan mualphona hi en teh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kan ro luahte chu hnam dang mite hnêna pêk a ni zo ta a, Kan inte chu hmêlhriat loh mite hnênah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Fahrahte leh pa nei lote kan ni ta a, Kan nute chu hmeithai ang mai an ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kan tuisik te man neiin kan in ta a, Kan thingtuahte pawh kan hnênah hralh a ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nghâwnga manin kan awm a; kan chau va, chawlh rêng kan nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aigupta leh Assuria hnênah kut kan dawh a; Khamkhawp chaw hmu tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kan pate zawng an sual a, an awm ta lo va; An khawlohnate kan phur a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawihte chu kan chungah an lal a; An kut ata min chhan chhuak tûr tu mah an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nun chân hlauhawm khawpin kan chaw kan ei ṭhîn; Thlalêra khandaih avâng chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan vunte chu thuk ang maiin a sa a; ṭâm kâng sâ avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zion-ah hmeichhiate chu an pâwngsual a, nulate chu Juda khawpuiahte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lal fate an kutin an khai a, upate hmêl an zah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tlângvâlte buh her khâwl an hertîr a; Naupangte thingtuah têl hnuaiah an pai chawn chawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Upaten kulh kawngka an kalsan a, tlangvâlten an hla sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kan thinlung hlimna a chuai ta; kan lâm lusûnah a chang ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kan lû ata lallukhum a tla ta; Kan chung a pik e, kan tisual ta si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hemi avâng hian kan thinlung a chau va, Hêng avâng hian kan mit a thim;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zion tlâng chu a ṭiau tâk avângin, Sihalte a chhûngah an lêng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang chu Lalpa , kumkhuain i lal a; I lalṭhutthlêng chu chhuan zawng zawng thlengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eng vângin nge kumkhuaa min theihnghilha, Chu leh chen min kalsan le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nangin i lam min hawitîr la; Tichuan, kan lo hawi ang; Hmasâng angin kan nite tithar ang che,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangin min paih thla dêra, Kan chungah i thin a ur nasa hle a nih loh chuan!
  </para>
</usx>
